# Telegram bot (owner notifications). Leave TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN empty to disable
# the whole integration — the app runs exactly as before.
# 1. Open @BotFather in Telegram, send /newbot, follow the prompts.
# 2. Paste the token BotFather returns below, and the bot's @handle (no '@').
# 3. Set TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET to any random string (min 16 chars).
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_BOT_USERNAME=
TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
